      "statement": "The directory segment sanitizes cwd via abbreviate_path, which calls strip_control on its result; the git, model, and dev-context segments each call strip_control on the specific host-provided strings they emit (branch name; display_name and effort.level; worktree name, agent.name and pr.review_state).",
