    {
      "id": "claim_2c0361b1deb4466588135246765fc77e",
      "statement": "The git branch name is the primary injection surface because it is sourced from subprocess output (git status --branch --porcelain); parse_status runs the branch through strip_control and returns None if the result is empty, so a fully-stripped branch hides the segment rather than emitting a blank or detached line.",
